        <groundspeak:log id="684214894">
          <groundspeak:date>2017-05-06T20:00:00</groundspeak:date>
          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="1636194">behmSquad</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BCP379 Bragg Creek&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anticipating a few more days to be able to log caps, I set out again today to clean up some in the area including two in Calgary and four in Kananaskis.  I was thankful for this quick find enabling me enough time to hike into the hills for a more difficult one.  Thanks for the cap.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
