          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP379-Bragg Creek.  Weren't sure if this one would be findable with all the snow but everything was good and lots of survey tape showing the way to GZ.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
